{"4797870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Babitonga: Puzzle Attack", "steam_appid": 4797870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5022490], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and reasoning skills in an addictive puzzle game where every move can trigger huge chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/e06d1c239f4803fc8a8b7fbbbd0247d5.poster.avif?t=1787192643\" width=240 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/e06d1c239f4803fc8a8b7fbbbd0247d5.webm?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/e06d1c239f4803fc8a8b7fbbbd0247d5.mp4?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade puzzle inspired by the classics of the 90s where IQ was required and match-3 wasn't a cash grab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/2cd512f2070be01fa8d5f2dd083df1a8.poster.avif?t=1787192643\" width=422 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/2cd512f2070be01fa8d5f2dd083df1a8.webm?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/2cd512f2070be01fa8d5f2dd083df1a8.mp4?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Tetris Attack / Panel de Pon<br>• Puzzle League<br>• Puyo Puyo<br>• Tetris versus modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll feel right at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/f74ff968235521afb19689b865d62d28.poster.avif?t=1787192643\" width=384 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/f74ff968235521afb19689b865d62d28.webm?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/f74ff968235521afb19689b865d62d28.mp4?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A return to the times when puzzle games tested your skill, not your wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;No luck, no boosters, no psychological tricks. Just skill.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/9bbc1d913aee7824456d0b16542f5d2d.poster.avif?t=1787192643\" width=422 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/9bbc1d913aee7824456d0b16542f5d2d.webm?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/9bbc1d913aee7824456d0b16542f5d2d.mp4?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap adjacent blocks to align three or more pieces of the same color and eliminate them from the board. As new lines appear from the bottom of the screen, you'll need to act quickly to prevent the blocks from reaching the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create combos, execute spectacular chains, and master advanced techniques to achieve ever-higher scores. While easy to learn, the strategic depth and fast pace ensure a constant challenge for players of all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone to beat your high scores or face opponents in intense duels where every combination can send obstacles to the rival side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo and chain system that rewards skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty that maintains tension until the very last moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability with increasingly greater challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn in minutes, hone your skills for years, and discover why this style of competitive puzzle continues to captivate players today.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/ccc0a796ddce81e00e484e98410c987a.poster.avif?t=1787192643\" width=240 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/ccc0a796ddce81e00e484e98410c987a.webm?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4797870/extras/ccc0a796ddce81e00e484e98410c987a.mp4?t=1787192643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><stro